---
layout: base.njk
title: "Clinical Departments — DHS Hospital Ahmedabad"
description: "Explore 15+ clinical departments at DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Ahmedabad — orthopedics, cardiology, neurosurgery, oncology, gastro, urology."
canonical: "https://www.dhshospitals.com/departments/"
breadcrumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { name: "Departments", url: "/departments/" }
activePage: "departments"
---

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Clinical Departments</h1>
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Departments</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-bottom:40px">Our hospital is accredited by NABH, reflecting our dedication to quality, safety, and continuous improvement across all departments.</p>
    <div class="dept-grid">
      {% for dept in departments %}
      <a href="/departments/{{ dept.slug }}/" class="dept-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
        <img src="{{ dept.image }}" alt="{{ dept.name }} department at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
        <div class="dept-card-body">
          <h3>{{ dept.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ dept.short_desc }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
      <a href="/departments/icu-critical-care/" class="dept-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
        <img src="/assets/images/client/icu-bg.jpg" alt="ICU & Critical Care department at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
        <div class="dept-card-body">
          <h3>ICU &amp; Critical Care</h3>
          <p>24/7 ICU &amp; Green Critical Care Unit in Vastrapur, Ahmedabad — advanced life-support systems and HEPA filters for critical patient care.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
